I have added the login 'nethack' to the host banjo.concert.net.  It allows
up to four people to play nethack at any given time.

To get in, just 'telnet banjo.concert.net' (or 'telnet 192.101.21.6') and
when prompted for a 'login:', enter 'nethack'  It will then prompt you for your
character's name (one word only, please).

Nethack that is running has the following options (in no particular order):

self-polymorphing, theology, sounds, kicking, thrones, fountains, sinks, 
altars, fancy mazes, Rogue level, special levels, oracle, Medusa, Kops, 
armies, long worms, golems, inferno, seduction, Tolkien extras, 
wand of probing, leashes, Hawaiian shirt, music, fruits, spells, named items, 
Elbereth, explore mode, HARD, redo-commands, screen clipping, shell command, 
mail, news file, command line completion, wizard mode, logfile, 
compress bones/level/save files, basic NetHack features

Enjoy..

BUT REMEMBER:  ONLY 4 AT A TIME (ENFORCED THROUGH SCRIPT), AND IT MAY GO AWAY
AT ANY TIME DEPENDING ON THE LOAD IT PUTS ON THE SYSTEM.

